# Pila Derflice

> Family-run sawmill in Derflice near Znojmo (South Moravia, Czech Republic). Sells firewood, construction and joinery lumber, sawmill by-products (sawdust, wood chips, slabs) and decorative stone, and does custom sawing, planing and impregnation. Delivers with its own truck across South Moravia and northern Austria; pickup at the sawmill is free. Orders through the online shop or an inquiry form; the site is in Czech, with a German version for Austria under /at.

Key facts:

- Address: Derflice 66, 671 28 Znojmo, Czech Republic (business owner Štěpán Merta, IČ 45665451, DIČ CZ6909094742)
- Phone: +420 602 446 339, +420 515 235 527; e-mail: stepan.merta@seznam.cz
- Opening hours: Monday to Friday 7:00–15:30, other times by arrangement
- Prices are in Czech crowns (CZK) and include VAT. The German site shows them converted to euros.
- Delivery to an address costs <%= Setting.delivery_czk_per_km %> Kč per km, counted there and back, one trip per order; the shop calculates it from the delivery address (customers can also type a town or postcode in the e-shop to see it before ordering). Pickup at the sawmill is free.
- Payment: cash on pickup, or bank transfer against a proforma invoice.
- For quantities, sizes or products not in the shop, customers send an inquiry from the contact page and get a quote.

